=== libgetc-callback-sigint-isearch
description: the signal is reported while readline still restores the terminal, so keys typed right after it may be echoed by the tty; only results are compared
ignore: screen cursor snaps
tags: libgetc callback SIGINT isearch
eof: off
--- script
option libgetc
add_history "make all"
callback "> "
--- keys
\C-rma\C-cq\r

